    {
      "id": "flow:confirm_recall_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "confirm_recall_flow",
        "description": "Step 2 of 2: submit the recall the client has explicitly confirmed. Pass the action_id from propose_recall. The system re-checks every rule; proposals expire after 15 minutes. Returns SUBMITTED with the review case_id (CASE-NNNNN) and the assigned team (Payment Operations) - the payment is set to RECALL_REQUESTED and a person decides the recall; funds are not auto-reversed. Otherwise returns NOT_EXECUTED with reason_code NO_SUCH_PROPOSAL, EXPIRED, ALREADY_EXECUTED, SESSION_INVALID or a rule&#39;s code. Only call after the client says yes to the exact proposal; state that a person will decide and the funds are not reversed automatically.",
